@startuml Reminders - Configure, Save, Test Email, Reset to Defaults
!theme plain
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false

actor User
boundary "Reminders Screen\n(RemindersView)" as RemindersUI
boundary "Booking Reminders" as BookingRemUI
boundary "Appointment Reminders" as ApptRemUI
boundary "Prescription Reminders" as RxRemUI

control "ReminderController" as RemC
entity "UserDAO/DB\n(default_reminder_config,\nbooking_comm_prefs)" as UserDB
entity "AppointmentReminder DAO/DB" as ApptRemDB
entity "PrescriptionReminder DAO/DB" as RxRemDB

control "EmailSender" as Mail
control "NotificationDispatcher" as Dispatch

== Open Reminders ==
User -> RemindersUI: Open reminders settings
RemindersUI -> RemC: load current settings\n+ saved defaults
RemC -> UserDB: load user's default reminder template\n+ booking comm prefs
RemC -> ApptRemDB: load appointment reminders (custom)
RemC -> RxRemDB: load prescription reminders (custom)
RemC --> RemindersUI: render cards\n(prefill only if custom exists)

== Booking reminders ==
User -> BookingRemUI: edit reminder fields\n(schedule, message, channels)
User -> BookingRemUI: Click "Send test email"
BookingRemUI -> RemC: sendTestEmail(template)
RemC -> Mail: send rendered email
RemC --> BookingRemUI: show inline confirmation\n(same label as Save)

User -> BookingRemUI: Click "Save reminder"
BookingRemUI -> RemC: saveBookingReminder(...)
RemC -> UserDB: update booking reminder rows/prefs
RemC --> BookingRemUI: show "Saved" confirmation

== Appointment reminders ==
User -> ApptRemUI: open a reminder card
alt User has saved defaults
  ApptRemUI -> ApptRemUI: show "Reset to default" button
end

User -> ApptRemUI: Click "Reset to default"
ApptRemUI -> RemC: load defaults + apply
RemC -> UserDB: load default reminder config
RemC --> ApptRemUI: update all fields\n(no autosave)\nshow "Reset to your saved defaults."

User -> ApptRemUI: Click "Send test email"
ApptRemUI -> RemC: sendTestEmail(template)
RemC -> Mail: send
RemC --> ApptRemUI: show "Test email sent." confirmation

User -> ApptRemUI: Click "Save reminder"
ApptRemUI -> RemC: saveAppointmentReminder(...)
RemC -> ApptRemDB: upsert appointment reminder row
RemC --> ApptRemUI: show "Saved" confirmation

== Prescription reminders ==
User -> RxRemUI: open a reminder card
alt User has saved defaults AND doses_per_day known
  RxRemUI -> RxRemUI: show "Reset to default" button
end

User -> RxRemUI: Click "Reset to default"
RxRemUI -> RemC: compute interval from prescription.doses_per_day\ninterval = floor(24 / doses)\n(null/0 -> hidden/disabled, 1 -> 24h)
RemC -> UserDB: load default reminder config
RemC -> RxRemDB: load prescription + doses_per_day
RemC --> RxRemUI: update all fields\n(no autosave)\nshow confirmation

User -> RxRemUI: Click "Send test email"
RxRemUI -> RemC: sendTestEmail(template)
RemC -> Mail: send
RemC --> RxRemUI: show confirmation

User -> RxRemUI: Click "Save reminder"
RxRemUI -> RemC: savePrescriptionReminder(...)
RemC -> RxRemDB: upsert prescription reminder row
RemC --> RxRemUI: show "Saved" confirmation

@enduml
